'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果联合谷歌与英伟达开发新一代AI模型Apple Foundation Model Cloud Pro</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果发布全新Siri并接入谷歌Gemini模型，强调以用户为本的AI发展理念</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 正式向美国 SEC 递交 IPO 申请草案，拟通过公开市场融资以支撑 AGI 研发</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴整合组织架构成立 Token Foundry 事业部，由 CEO 吴泳铭直接挂帅</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/08bed301ae5444f1e85803f005b5985b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月8日，阿里巴巴宣布战略升级，将通义大模型事业部与未来生活实验室合并，成立 Token Foundry 事业部，由集团 CEO 吴泳铭直接挂帅。此次调整旨在实现模型能力与应用场景的深度协同，原通义大模型事业部核心力量及 Happy Horse、Happy Oyster 等业务线均并入该部门。同时，首席科学家周靖人将牵头成立 AI 未来研究院。阿里已形成从算力、云基础设施、大模型底座到原生 AI 软件的全栈技术体系。商业化方面，阿里 AI 业务已进入回报周期，AI 相关产品收入连续十一个季度实现三位数增长，预计百炼 MaaS 平台等 AI 模型与应用服务的年化经常性收入（ARR）今年底有望突破 300 亿元。技术层面，Qwen-3.7 系列模型编程能力领先，HappyHorse-1.0 模型在 Artifici</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团发布AMP协议，打通全球智能体支付链路并构建信任体系</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8033d17a3a2e31a3e10cd6157044b2ab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团近日正式发布移动智能体协议（Agentic Mobile Protocol，简称AMP），旨在为全球智能体（Agent）提供统一的支付底座。该协议通过标准化接入层，打通电子钱包、银行App与AI平台，实现“一次构建，全球运营”。用户仅需将钱包绑定至智能体，即可在对话中直接下达支付指令，并支持实时监控与预算设定。针对安全痛点，AMP引入“全方位智能体认证体系（KYA）”，确保商户能识别智能体身份与信用评级。同时，蚂蚁国际将“敢付敢赔”体系升级为“AgentSafePay”，为AI执行的交易提供资金安全兜底。目前，蚂蚁国际已链接全球20亿消费者与1.5亿商户，并正联合千问、Gemini等主流AI平台，填补智能体在移动生态中支付标准的空白，加速全球商业迈入“智能体经济”时代。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果联合谷歌与英伟达开发新一代AI模型Apple Foundation Model Cloud Pro</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8b39bc8fda92ab60fca5393f84318fb7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果、谷歌与英伟达正式宣布达成深度合作，联合开发新一代人工智能模型Apple Foundation Model Cloud Pro。该模型在性能上对标谷歌Gemini，技术架构完全基于英伟达高性能GPU集群运行，并深度集成至苹果私有云计算（Private Cloud Compute）体系中。苹果人工智能业务负责人Amal Subramanian表示，此举旨在平衡高性能计算与隐私保护。该合作将直接推动Siri等苹果原生应用向AI Agent演进，并确立端云协同与隐私安全并行的技术范式。在算力成本高企的背景下，三大巨头的联手优化了底层资源配置，不仅重塑了全球AI产业链竞争格局，也标志着业界对Secured AI需求的进一步深化，将加速全球人工智能终端及核心场景的深层变革。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果发布全新Siri并接入谷歌Gemini模型，强调以用户为本的AI发展理念</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6966a0a6588676ea07ac46e8d14ff7b2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在2026年WWDC大会上，苹果正式发布新版Siri，通过引入谷歌Gemini大模型及全新AI架构，显著提升了Siri在各类App中的协同能力。苹果软件工程高级副总裁克雷格在会上抨击行业“为AI而AI”的功利倾向，强调Apple Intelligence应聚焦个性化与实用性，解决用户生活痛点。目前，开发者已可试用新版Siri，普通用户预计今年晚些时候迎来Beta测试版。受限于地区政策与监管要求，该功能初期暂不向欧盟地区提供，中国大陆地区则需配合本地监管要求推进相关工作。此次更新标志着苹果在AI战略上采取了更务实的整合路径，旨在通过技术协同提升产品效率，而非盲目堆砌AI功能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 正式向美国 SEC 递交 IPO 申请草案，拟通过公开市场融资以支撑 AGI 研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 已正式向美国证券交易委员会（SEC）提交 IPO 申请草案，标志着公司正式开启迈向公开资本市场的进程。此前，OpenAI 已完成重组，将营利主体转为 OpenAI Group 公共利益公司（PBC），原有非营利母体 OpenAI 基金会持有约 26% 股份。尽管 OpenAI 今年 1 月年化收入已突破 200 亿美元，但受限于庞大的算力投入，2026 年预计亏损缺口在 140 亿至 250 亿美元之间。CEO 山姆·奥特曼重申“普及 AGI”愿景，将核心战略聚焦于打造“自动化 AI 研究员”、加速经济与科学发展，以及实现个人化 AI 产品普及。随着 OpenAI 与 Anthropic 先后启动 IPO，业内预测两家公司上市后市值均有望冲击万亿美元规模。此次上市不仅是两家顶级 AI 独角兽的资本</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
